  "solution": "Vì điện tích dịch chuyển lệch với phương của điện trường một góc <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><msup><mn>60</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></semantics></math>, nên <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mover><mi>d</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>60</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math>. <br>\n\t\tLực tĩnh điện tác dụng lên điện tích là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>q</mi><mover><mi>E</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>⇒</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>q</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mover><mi>E</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow></msup><mo>⋅</mo><mn>1</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></semantics></math> N.<br>\n\t\tTa có <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>⋅</mo><mover><mi>d</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>F</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo>cos</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mover><mi>d</mi><mo accent=\"true\"